{"meta":{"ph":"ˈskeɪtbɔːd; NAmE ˈskeɪtbɔːrd","pos":"noun","stars":"★★"},"defs":[{"def":"a short narrow board with small wheels at each end, which you stand on and ride as a sport 滑板verbnoun","ex":[{"s":"Southbank, at an eastern bend in the Thames, is the center of British skateboarding, where the continuous crashing of skateboards left your head ringing .I loved it.","src":"2021全国甲卷·阅读理解C","cat":"gaokao","year":2021,"t":"南岸，在泰晤士河向东的拐弯处，是英国滑板运动的中心，滑板不断的撞击声让你的脑袋嗡嗡作响。我爱上了那里。"},{"s":"I tried skateboarding there, but the locals were far less welcoming.","src":"2021全国甲卷·阅读理解C","cat":"gaokao","year":2021,"t":"我在那里尝试滑板，但当地人远不那么热情。"},{"s":"To join the skateboarding.","src":"2021全国甲卷·阅读理解C","cat":"gaokao","year":2021,"t":"以参滑板."},{"s":"After class on Wednesday, I hurried to the school skateboarding club.","src":"外研社B1 U1","cat":"waiyan","t":"周三放学后，我赶忙去学校的滑板俱乐部。"},{"s":"At the club,1 had my first try at skateboarding and fell off the board a lot.","src":"外研社B1 U1","cat":"waiyan","t":"在俱乐部，我第一次尝试滑板，经常从板上摔下来。"},{"s":"Other times I jumped on my skateboard and rode around my neighbourhood, or just took a long walk.","src":"人教选必3 U2","cat":"renjiao","t":"有时我跳上滑板 绕着我的邻居走 或者走长路"},{"s":"Do something you really like—to ride a skateboard, go bowling, or watch a comedy—whatever stimulates your mind and makes you feel happy.","src":"人教选必3 U2","cat":"renjiao","t":"做一些你真正喜欢的事情——骑滑板,打保龄球,或者看喜剧——无论什么刺激你的思想,让你感到快乐."},{"s":"Other sports which are thought to appeal to a younger audience have also been added, such as skateboarding, surfing and sport climbing.","src":"译林选必2 U4","cat":"yilin","t":"还增加了被认为吸引年轻观众的其他运动,如滑板、冲浪和运动攀登。"}]}]}